  {
    "id": 4001042030750,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──でね～、冬優子ちゃんがすごいのなんの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "029",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030750"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030760,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『この人にはこの種目がいいと思う～』みたいに\r\n言ってたやつ、全部そのとおりに決めちゃって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030760"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030770,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちらが出ようとしてた種目もちゃんと取ってて──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030770"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030780,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "『ふゆちゃんのおかげで進行助かったよ～』とかも\r\n言われてて、ちょー感謝されてた！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030780"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030790,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちなんて話し合いの時、リレーでアンカーになれるように\r\nすっごい推してもらったし！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030790"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030800,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ハンパなくすごいしちょー自慢～！　\r\nってカンジ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030800"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、なるほど！\r\n確かに冬優子はそういうの得意だもんな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かっこよかっただろうなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030810,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "マジでそう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030810"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030820,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "────……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030820"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030830,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……冬優子ちゃん、\r\nいっつもストレイライトのこと考えてくれてて……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030830"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030840,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……いっつも、４つ考えてるんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030840"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……４つ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030850,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030850"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001042030860,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "冬優子ちゃんのことと、あさひちゃんのことと、\r\nうちのことと、ストレイライトのこと",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104203/4001042030860"
  },
  {
